<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  MediVault supervisor LaunchAgent (SMAppService.agent contract).

  This plist ships INSIDE the app bundle at
  MediVault.app/Contents/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.medivault.supervisor.plist
  and is registered from the desktop app at first-run setup via
  SMAppService.agent.register() (ServiceManagement.framework, macOS 13+).
  It is the USER-scoped agent: the backend runs while the doctor is logged
  in, independent of the desktop window.

  Fields (acceptance/macos-architecture-audit.md, SMAPPSERVICE DESIGN):
    Label          dev.medivault.supervisor
    Program        the supervisor binary at its app-bundle location
    RunAtLoad      true  — starts at login
    KeepAlive      true  — launchd restarts the supervisor itself on crash
    ProcessType    Background — App Nap / scheduling class for a daemon-like agent
    Disabled       false

  NOTES
    - No StandardOutPath/StandardErrorPath: launchd capture paths must be
      per-user ABSOLUTE, which cannot be known at bundle-build time. The
      supervisor performs its own structured file logging into
      ~/Library/Logs/MediVault/ (supervisor.log, postgres.log, api.log);
      pre-logging early crashes are observable via the unified log:
        log show (predicate: process == "mediavault-supervisor")
    - The supervisor's own crash resilience is redundant by design with
      KeepAlive (launchd = outer ring, supervisor restart backoff = inner
      ring for the CHILDREN).
    - Registration/UX (Login Items approval pane) is an interactive-cloud-Mac
      proof, NOT a CI proof; CI proves the foreground lifecycle contract of
      the same binary. SMAppService registration lands with the app-bundle
      stage.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>dev.medivault.supervisor</string>

    <key>Program</key>
    <string>/Applications/MediVault.app/Contents/MacOS/mediavault-supervisor</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Applications/MediVault.app/Contents/MacOS/mediavault-supervisor</string>
        <string>run</string>
        <string>--config</string>
        <string>/Applications/MediVault.app/Contents/Resources/supervisor-config.json</string>
    </array>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>

    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>

    <key>ProcessType</key>
    <string>Background</string>

    <key>Disabled</key>
    <false/>

    <key>ExitTimeOut</key>
    <integer>90</integer>
</dict>
</plist>
